<title>USA: Evergreen Media to buy more radio stations.</title>
<headline>Evergreen Media to buy more radio stations.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Evergreen Media Corp said Friday it had signed deals to buy additional radio stations in San Francisco and Philadelphia.</p>
<p>Evergreen said it will buy KKSF-FM, KDFC-FM and KDFC-AM in San Francisco from Brown Organization for $115 million, and WDAS-FM and WDAS-AM in Philadelphia from Beasley Broadcast Group for $103 million.</p>
</text>
